        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo CV-86, Mortise Lock Conversion Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis filler plate allows for the conversion from an 86 cut out (mortise lock) to a 161 cut out (standard tube latch). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nJust remove the old Mortise Lock box. Screw the filler plate into the doors edge existing mortise lock holes. You can now install a standard latch or deadbolt latch. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-CV-86_size.gif?v=1704354728\" width=\"420\" height=\"306\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo CV-86 mortise conversion plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as with centered cut-out <a href=\"/products/8-inch-mortise-lock-conversion-plate-with-centered-cut-out-don-jo-cv-86-c-pc\"><b>Don-Jo CV-86-C Mortise Lock Conversion Plate</b></a>  and with 2 latch holes <a href=\"/products/mortise-lock-conversion-plate-don-jo-cv-8624\"><b>Don-Jo CV-8624 Mortise Lock Conversion Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo CV-86 Mortise Conversion Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screws: (2) each #12-24 x 1/2\" Flat Head Machine Screws</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CV-86.pdf?v=1704262278\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo CV-86 Conversion Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
