                "title": "Mortise Lock Conversion Plate, Don-Jo CV-86",
                "description": "Don-Jo CV-86 mortise conversion plate. This filler plate allows for the conversion from an 86 cut out (mortise lock) to a 161 cut out (standard tube latch). Just remove the old Mortise Lock box. Screws the filler plate into the doors edge existing mortise lock holes. You can now install a standard latch or deadbolt latch. ",
